<title>POLAND: Polish Fin Min sees 1996 inflation 18.4-18.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Polish Fin Min sees 1996 inflation 18.4-18.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish consumer price inflation in 1996 is estimated at between 18.4 and 18.6 percent against 21.6 percent in 1995, Finance Minister Grzegorz Kolodko said on Monday.</p>
</text>
